# Derived measurement output — do NOT commit.
#
# Every bench run re-creates these: one `*.logits.npz` per leg cell (that cell's logits
# + input_ids, up to ~20 MB each — hundreds of MB for the full matrix). They are
# regenerable from the checkpoints alone, so the repository keeps the small JSON leg
# records and `parity_digest.json` instead; `hf_bench.py --report` renders the same
# numbers from those (see bench_logs/CONTEXT.md, section "hf_bench.py").
*.logits.npz
*.npy
*.bin
